  - Chosen thoroughness: `medium` (297 LoC lib + 236 LoC tests; small enough to read end-to-end, too much to claim `high` without much deeper formal reasoning)
  - Verification outcome: **pass** (with findings, all recorded below; no blockers)
  
  ## External verification
  
  1. Located crate via `cargo run -- crev crate dir crev-recursive-digest 0.6.0`.
  2. Read `.cargo_vcs_info.json`:
     ```json
